  "title": "ExtorQ - Collector & Pipeline Health",
  "description": "Is telemetry arriving? Collector freshness (stale = now - last success > 3 x interval), collector and ingestion lag, spool backlog, detection rule execution and the ingestion security boundary (quarantine, rejected producers).",
