      "description": "Records waiting in each SDK collector's durable outbox (gateway unreachable or slow). Source: extorq.collector_health. A growing line means delivery is falling behind. Dashed lines: 100 and 1000 records. OpenTelemetry queue requests appear separately.",
      "datasource": {
